2 * sin(3*x)/3 - (2/3) ∫ x * sin(3*x) dx\n\nNow I need ∫ x * sin(3*x) dx.\n\nIntegration by parts:\n- u = x, dv = sin(3*x) dx\n- du = dx, v = -cos(3*x)/3\n\n∫ x * sin(3*x) dx = -x * cos(3*x)/3 - ∫ (-cos(3*x)/3) dx\n= -x * cos(3*x)/3 + (1/3) ∫ cos(3*x) dx\n= -x * cos(3*x)/3 + (1/3) * sin(3*x)/3\n= -x * cos(3*x)/3 + sin(3*x)/9\n\nNow let me work back up:\n\n∫ x**2 * cos(3*x) dx = x**2 * sin(3*x)/3 - (2/3) * (-x * cos(3*x)/3 + sin(3*x)/9)\n= x**2 * sin(3*x)/3 - (2/3) * (-x * cos(3*x)/3) - (2/3) * (sin(3*x)/9)\n= x**2 * sin(3*x)/3 + 2*x * cos(3*x)/9 - 2*sin(3*x)/27\n\n∫ x**3 * sin(3*x) dx = -x**3 * cos(3*x)/3 + x**2 * sin(3*x)/3 + 2*x * cos(3*x)/9 - 2*sin(3*x)/27\n\n∫ x**4 * cos(3*x) dx = x**4 * sin(3*x)/3 - (4/3) * (-x**3 * cos(3*x)/3 + x**2 * sin(3*x)/3 + 2*x * cos(3*x)/9 - 2*sin(3*x)/27)\n= x**4 * sin(3*x)/3 + (4*x**3 * cos(3*x))/9 - (4*x**2 * sin(3*x))/9 - (8*x * cos(3*x))/27 + (8*sin(3*x))/81\n\nNow the final answer:\n∫ -x**5 * sin(3*x) dx = x**5 * cos(3*x)/3 - (5/3) * [x**4 * sin(3*x)/3 + (4*x**3 * cos(3*x))/9 - (4*x**2 * sin(3*x))/9 - (8*x * cos(3*x))/27 + (8*sin(3*x))/81]\n\n= x**5 * cos(3*x)/3 - (5*x**4 * sin(3*x))/9 - (20*x**3 * cos(3*x))/27 + (20*x**2 * sin(3*x))/27 + (40*x * cos(3*x))/81 - (40*sin(3*x))/243\n\nLet me verify this by differentiating:\n\nd/dx [x**5 * cos(3*x)/3] = 5*x**4 * cos(3*x)/3 - x**5 * sin(3*x)\n\nd/dx [-(5*x**4 * sin(3*x))/9] = -(20*x**3 * sin(3*x))/9 - (5*x**4 * cos(3*x))/3\n\nd/dx [-(20*x**3 * cos(3*x))/27] = -(60*x**2 * cos(3*x))/27 + (60*x**3 * sin(3*x))/27\n= -(20*x**2 * cos(3*x))/9 + (20*x**3 * sin(3*x))/9\n\nd/dx [(20*x**2 * sin(3*x))/27] = (40*x * sin(3*x))/27 + (60*x**2 * cos(3*x))/27\n= (40*x * sin(3*x))/27 + (20*x**2 * cos(3*x))/9\n\nd/dx [(40*x * cos(3*x))/81] = (40 * cos(3*x))/81 - (120*x * sin(3*x))/81\n= (40 * cos(3*x))/81 - (40*x * sin(3*x))/27\n\nd/dx [-(40*sin(3*x))/243] = -(120*cos(3*x))/243\n= -(40*cos(3*x))/81\n\nNow let me add them all up:\n\nx**5 * sin(3*x) terms: -x**5 * sin(3*x) ✓ (this is the integrand)\n\nx**4